archive_attestation=<tor tree>/.provenance source_patch=dynhost-stream-shutdown-v2, written only when libtor.a defines dynhost_stream_init
note=The patch makes the dynhost subsystem shutdown fire the terminal event for every pending and active stream and refuse later opens. The host build applies it only for the compile and reverts it, so the submodule checkout keeps the pinned bytes.
